WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.099
Formative knowledge check test mode This ten-question formative test

00:00:04.126 --> 00:00:07.981
is separate from ungraded practice The pass mark is

00:00:08.034 --> 00:00:12.388
eighty percent You have three total submissions per question

00:00:12.428 --> 00:00:16.428
and two total quiz attempts There are no penalties

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:21.139
or partial marks After a failed first quiz complete

00:00:21.165 --> 00:00:24.402
relevant teaching review and practice before the one permitted

00:00:24.442 --> 00:00:28.560
retry Answer keys are withheld until the quiz has

00:00:28.573 --> 00:00:32.586
reached its final outcome This browser test is not

00:00:32.626 --> 00:00:35.744
an authenticated grade or a final examination
